                <invention-title lang="fr">GUIDAGE DE PLACEMENT DE CAMÉRA</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">CAMERA PLACEMENT GUIDANCE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The description relates to cameras, such as security cameras, and providing guidance for positioning cameras to achieve desired goals. One example can receive an image of a scene overlaid with transparent indicators that reflect accuracy of object detection in individual regions of the image. The example can correlate input received from the user on the display relative to the regions. The example can analyze subsequent images of the scene with rules derived from the input from the user.</p>
            </abstract>
